CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# The agent worktree container. Tooling state, never product — and a worktree committed into
# the tree it is a worktree OF is a loop nobody unpicks.
.claude/

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
/graft/
